---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead
			title="Insurance Coverage for Treatment in Shanghai | MedInSh"
			description="International health insurance accepted at Shanghai's top hospitals. Direct billing partners including Cigna, BUPA, AIA, Aetna, Ping An, MSH, and 15+ more."
		/>
		<style>
			.page-hero { position: relative; width: 100vw; margin-left: calc(-50vw + 50%); overflow: hidden; }
			.page-hero img { width: 100%; height: 300px; object-fit: cover; display: block; }
			.page-hero-overlay { position: absolute; bottom: 0; left: 0; right: 0; padding: 3em 3em 2em; background: linear-gradient(transparent, rgba(0,0,0,0.8)); color: white; }
			.page-hero-overlay h1 { color: white; font-size: 2.4em; margin-bottom: 0.3em; }
			.page-hero-overlay p { opacity: 0.9; max-width: 600px; margin: 0; }
			.content { max-width: 860px; margin: 0 auto; }
			.section { margin: 2.5em 0; }
			.section h2 { font-size: 1.6em; padding-bottom: 0.5em; border-bottom: 2px solid var(--accent); margin-bottom: 1em; }
			.section h3 { font-size: 1.15em; margin-top: 1.5em; color: var(--accent-dark); }

			.provider-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 1em; margin-top: 1em; }
			.provider-card { background: white; border: 1px solid rgb(var(--gray-light)); border-radius: 8px; padding: 1.2em 1.4em; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 1em; transition: box-shadow 0.2s; }
			.provider-card:hover { box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.06); }
			.provider-icon { width: 44px; height: 44px; background: var(--accent-light); border-radius: 8px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 1.1em; font-weight: 700; color: var(--accent); flex-shrink: 0; }
			.provider-info h4 { margin: 0 0 0.2em; font-size: 1em; }
			.provider-info p { margin: 0; font-size: 0.85em; color: rgb(var(--gray)); line-height: 1.5; }
			.badge { display: inline-block; padding: 0.1em 0.5em; border-radius: 3px; font-size: 0.7em; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.04em; margin-bottom: 0.2em; }
			.badge-direct { background: var(--green-light); color: var(--green); }

			.faq-item { border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(var(--gray-light)); padding: 1.2em 0; }
			.faq-item h4 { margin: 0 0 0.4em; font-size: 1.05em; color: var(--accent-dark); }
			.faq-item p { margin: 0; font-size: 0.92em; color: rgb(var(--gray-dark)); }

			.alert { padding: 1.2em 1.5em; border-radius: 8px; margin: 1.5em 0; font-size: 0.95em; }
			.alert-info { background: var(--accent-light); border-left: 4px solid var(--accent); }
			.alert h4 { margin: 0 0 0.3em; }
			.alert p { margin: 0; }

			@media (max-width: 720px) {
				.page-hero img { height: 220px; }
				.page-hero-overlay { padding: 2em 1.5em 1.5em; }
				.page-hero-overlay h1 { font-size: 1.6em; }
				.provider-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
			}
		</style>
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header />
		<main>
			<section class="page-hero">
				<img src="/images/patient-care.jpg" alt="Patient receiving care" />
				<div class="page-hero-overlay">
					<h1>Insurance & Billing</h1>
					<p>17+ insurance providers with direct billing at Shanghai's top hospitals. International and domestic coverage accepted.</p>
				</div>
			</section>

			<div class="content">

				<section class="section">
					<h2>Direct Billing Partners</h2>
					<p>
						Shanghai's international hospital departments maintain direct billing agreements with major
						global and domestic insurance providers. This means <strong>you don't pay upfront</strong> — the hospital
						bills your insurer directly. Coverage depends on your specific policy and plan level.
					</p>
					<p>
						Below are insurers with confirmed direct billing relationships at Shanghai's leading hospitals
						(including Shanghai Jiahui International Hospital, United Family Hospital, and major public
						hospital international departments).
					</p>

					<h3>United States & Global</h3>
					<div class="provider-grid">
						<div class="provider-card">
							<div class="provider-icon">CG</div>
							<div class="provider-info">
								<span class="badge badge-direct">Direct Billing</span>
								<h4>Cigna Global</h4>
								<p>International health plans with direct billing at major Shanghai hospitals. Also operates as Cigna & CMB (招商信诺) in China.</p>
							</div>
						</div>
						<div class="provider-card">
							<div class="provider-icon">CC</div>
							<div class="provider-info">
								<span class="badge badge-direct">Direct Billing</span>
								<h4>Cigna & CMB (招商信诺)</h4>
								<p>Joint venture between Cigna and China Merchants Bank. Extensive direct billing network in Shanghai hospitals.</p>
							</div>
						</div>
						<div class="provider-card">
							<div class="provider-icon">AE</div>
							<div class="provider-info">
								<span class="badge badge-direct">Direct Billing</span>
								<h4>Aetna International</h4>
								<p>Global health insurance with direct billing partners in Shanghai. Verify your plan covers overseas surgical treatment.</p>
							</div>
						</div>
						<div class="provider-card">
							<div class="provider-icon">UH</div>
							<div class="provider-info">
								<span class="badge badge-direct">Direct Billing</span>
								<h4>United Healthcare Global</h4>
								<p>International plans with direct billing in China. Check if your employer-sponsored plan includes overseas coverage.</p>
							</div>
						</div>
						<div class="provider-card">
							<div class="provider-icon">GB</div>
							<div class="provider-info">
								<span class="badge badge-direct">Direct Billing</span>
								<h4>GeoBlue</h4>
								<p>Blue Cross Blue Shield's international arm. Direct billing at Shanghai hospitals. Strong network for US expats and travelers.</p>
							</div>
						</div>
						<div class="provider-card">
							<div class="provider-icon">WB</div>
							<div class="provider-info">
								<span class="badge badge-direct">Direct Billing</span>
								<h4>WellBe / FB Medical</h4>
								<p>International medical communication and insurance coordination services for foreign patients in Shanghai.</p>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>

					<h3>United Kingdom & Europe</h3>
					<div class="provider-grid">
						<div class="provider-card">
							<div class="provider-icon">BP</div>
							<div class="provider-info">
								<span class="badge badge-direct">Direct Billing</span>
								<h4>Bupa Global</h4>
								<p>One of the largest international health insurers. Direct billing at Shanghai Jiahui and United Family hospitals.</p>
							</div>
						</div>
						<div class="provider-card">
							<div class="provider-icon">AX</div>
							<div class="provider-info">
								<span class="badge badge-direct">Direct Billing</span>
								<h4>AXA - Global Healthcare</h4>
								<p>International private medical insurance with direct billing partners in Shanghai's international hospitals.</p>
							</div>
						</div>
						<div class="provider-card">
							<div class="provider-icon">AL</div>
							<div class="provider-info">
								<span class="badge badge-direct">Direct Billing</span>
								<h4>Allianz (安联)</h4>
								<p>Global health insurance with extensive Asia-Pacific network. Direct billing at major Shanghai hospitals.</p>
							</div>
						</div>
						<div class="provider-card">
							<div class="provider-icon">ER</div>
							<div class="provider-info">
								<span class="badge badge-direct">Direct Billing</span>
								<h4>ERGO Assistance</h4>
								<p>International assistance and insurance coordination services. Direct billing at Shanghai hospitals for policyholders.</p>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>

					<h3>Asia-Pacific</h3>
					<div class="provider-grid">
						<div class="provider-card">
							<div class="provider-icon">AI</div>
							<div class="provider-info">
								<span class="badge badge-direct">Direct Billing</span>
								<h4>AIA (友邦保险)</h4>
								<p>Asia's largest independent life insurance group. Direct billing with Shanghai international hospitals. Check your HK/SG policy for mainland China coverage.</p>
							</div>
						</div>
						<div class="provider-card">
							<div class="provider-icon">GE</div>
							<div class="provider-info">
								<span class="badge badge-direct">Direct Billing</span>
								<h4>Generali China (中意人寿)</h4>
								<p>Joint venture between Generali and CNPC. Commercial health insurance accepted at Shanghai international hospitals.</p>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>

					<h3>China Domestic (本土)</h3>
					<div class="provider-grid">
						<div class="provider-card">
							<div class="provider-icon">PA</div>
							<div class="provider-info">
								<span class="badge badge-direct">Direct Billing</span>
								<h4>Ping An Insurance (中国平安)</h4>
								<p>China's largest insurer. Offers health insurance for foreign residents and direct billing with Shanghai international hospital departments.</p>
							</div>
						</div>
						<div class="provider-card">
							<div class="provider-icon">MS</div>
							<div class="provider-info">
								<span class="badge badge-direct">Direct Billing</span>
								<h4>MSH China (万欣和)</h4>
								<p>Leading international health insurance administrator in China. Extensive hospital network across Shanghai. Popular with expats and medical tourists.</p>
							</div>
						</div>
						<div class="provider-card">
							<div class="provider-icon">TK</div>
							<div class="provider-info">
								<span class="badge badge-direct">Direct Billing</span>
								<h4>Taikang Life (泰康人寿)</h4>
								<p>Major Chinese life and health insurer. Commercial health insurance with direct billing at international hospital departments in Shanghai.</p>
							</div>
						</div>
						<div class="provider-card">
							<div class="provider-icon">HT</div>
							<div class="provider-info">
								<span class="badge badge-direct">Direct Billing</span>
								<h4>Huatai Insurance Broker (华泰保险经纪)</h4>
								<p>Major Chinese insurance brokerage with commercial health insurance products accepted at Shanghai international hospitals.</p>
							</div>
						</div>
						<div class="provider-card">
							<div class="provider-icon">CP</div>
							<div class="provider-info">
								<span class="badge badge-direct">Direct Billing</span>
								<h4>CPIC (太平洋保险)</h4>
								<p>China Pacific Insurance. One of China's largest insurers with commercial health products and direct billing at major Shanghai hospitals.</p>
							</div>
						</div>
						<div class="provider-card">
							<div class="provider-icon">IC</div>
							<div class="provider-info">
								<span class="badge badge-direct">Direct Billing</span>
								<h4>ICBC-AXA Life (工银安盛人寿)</h4>
								<p>Joint venture between ICBC and AXA. Health insurance with direct billing at Shanghai international hospitals.</p>
							</div>
						</div>
						<div class="provider-card">
							<div class="provider-icon">ML</div>
							<div class="provider-info">
								<span class="badge badge-direct">Direct Billing</span>
								<h4>MediLink-Global</h4>
								<p>International health insurance administrator specializing in direct billing with hospitals across China.</p>
							</div>
						</div>
						<div class="provider-card">
							<div class="provider-icon">FH</div>
							<div class="provider-info">
								<span class="badge badge-direct">Direct Billing</span>
								<h4>Fosun Health (复星联合健康保险)</h4>
								<p>Fosun Group's health insurance arm. Commercial health products with direct billing at Shanghai hospitals.</p>
							</div>
						</div>
						<div class="provider-card">
							<div class="provider-icon">JD</div>
							<div class="provider-info">
								<span class="badge badge-direct">Direct Billing</span>
								<h4>JD-Allianz (京东安联)</h4>
								<p>Joint venture between JD.com and Allianz. Health and travel insurance with direct billing at Shanghai international hospitals.</p>
							</div>
						</div>
						<div class="provider-card">
							<div class="provider-icon">BP</div>
							<div class="provider-info">
								<span class="badge badge-direct">Direct Billing</span>
								<h4>Blue Pass</h4>
								<p>International health insurance with direct billing at Shanghai hospitals. Popular with the expat community.</p>
							</div>
						</div>
						<div class="provider-card">
							<div class="provider-icon">SB</div>
							<div class="provider-info">
								<span class="badge badge-direct">Direct Billing</span>
								<h4>商保通 (ShangBaoTong)</h4>
								<p>Commercial insurance coordination platform with direct billing at major Shanghai international hospital departments.</p>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>
				</section>

				<section class="section">
					<h2>How Direct Billing Works</h2>
					<div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 1em; margin-top: 1em;">
						<div style="text-align: center;">
							<div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--accent); color: white; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 0.5em;">1</div>
							<h4 style="font-size: 0.9em; margin: 0 0 0.3em;">Verify Coverage</h4>
							<p style="font-size: 0.82em; color: rgb(var(--gray)); margin: 0;">Contact your insurer to confirm overseas surgical treatment is covered under your plan.</p>
						</div>
						<div style="text-align: center;">
							<div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--accent); color: white; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 0.5em;">2</div>
							<h4 style="font-size: 0.9em; margin: 0 0 0.3em;">Pre-Authorization</h4>
							<p style="font-size: 0.82em; color: rgb(var(--gray)); margin: 0;">Your insurer issues a Guarantee of Payment (GOP) or pre-authorization letter to the hospital.</p>
						</div>
						<div style="text-align: center;">
							<div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--accent); color: white; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 0.5em;">3</div>
							<h4 style="font-size: 0.9em; margin: 0 0 0.3em;">Treatment</h4>
							<p style="font-size: 0.82em; color: rgb(var(--gray)); margin: 0;">Hospital bills your insurer directly. You only pay any co-pay or deductible at discharge.</p>
						</div>
						<div style="text-align: center;">
							<div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--accent); color: white; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 0.5em;">4</div>
							<h4 style="font-size: 0.9em; margin: 0 0 0.3em;">Follow-Up</h4>
							<p style="font-size: 0.82em; color: rgb(var(--gray)); margin: 0;">Discharge summary sent to your insurer. Remote follow-up consultations may also be covered.</p>
						</div>
					</div>

					<div class="alert alert-info" style="margin-top: 2em;">
						<h4>Don't see your insurer?</h4>
						<p>
							Many additional insurers have billing arrangements not listed here. Contact the hospital's
							international department with your insurance details — they can check if your provider is
							in their network. Even without direct billing, most hospitals accept payment by credit card
							and provide itemized invoices for reimbursement from any insurer.
						</p>
					</div>
				</section>

				<section class="section">
					<h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>

					<div class="faq-item">
						<h4>Will my US insurance cover surgery in China?</h4>
						<p>Some international plans (Cigna Global, Aetna International, UHC Global, GeoBlue) cover treatment abroad, including China. Standard domestic US plans (HMO, PPO) typically do not cover overseas treatment unless you have a global rider. Always verify with your insurer before booking.</p>
					</div>
					<div class="faq-item">
						<h4>Does the NHS cover treatment in Shanghai?</h4>
						<p>No. The NHS only covers treatment within the UK (and limited reciprocal agreements with EEA countries). You would need private international insurance or self-pay for treatment in Shanghai.</p>
					</div>
					<div class="faq-item">
						<h4>What if I don't have international insurance?</h4>
						<p>Self-pay is common and straightforward. Shanghai hospital international departments provide transparent pricing upfront. Payment by credit card (Visa, Mastercard, UnionPay) or bank transfer. Itemized invoices provided for any reimbursement claims.</p>
					</div>
					<div class="faq-item">
						<h4>Can I get insurance specifically for this trip?</h4>
						<p>Short-term international health insurance (e.g., from Cigna, Allianz, or Bupa) can sometimes be purchased to cover a planned medical trip. However, most policies have waiting periods or exclusions for pre-existing conditions. This is worth exploring but should not be your primary plan.</p>
					</div>
					<div class="faq-item">
						<h4>Does AIA cover mainland China hospitals?</h4>
						<p>Yes. AIA (友邦) operates in mainland China and maintains direct billing agreements with Shanghai international hospitals. If you hold an AIA policy from Hong Kong, Singapore, or other Asian markets, check whether your plan includes mainland China coverage — many do.</p>
					</div>
					<div class="faq-item">
						<h4>Can I use Chinese domestic insurance as a foreigner?</h4>
						<p>Some Chinese insurers (Ping An, Taikang, CPIC) offer commercial health insurance products for foreign residents in China. MSH China and MediLink-Global specialize in international health insurance administration with strong hospital networks in Shanghai.</p>
					</div>
				</section>

			</div>
		</main>
		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>
